(transition-truth-extension)
*mode point-mass
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 transition_demo start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=0 long=0 lat=0 vel=10 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=10
  *segment 1 powered
    *integ dt=0.1 dtprnt=0.1
    *prop thrust=10 mdot=0
    *when time>0.2 goto 2
  *segment 2 separated
    *increment q_rail=-0.20
    *when time>0.4 stop
*end
